<title>UK: Credit Local adds 200bln lire to 10yr bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local adds 200bln lire to 10yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Monte dei Paschi de Siena.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT   *500 BLN LIRE  COUPON     8.125 PCT MATURITY    06.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    06.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*ADDS 200 BILLION LIRE</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
